            <ArticleTitle>[Pneumatosis cystoides intestinalis, treated with laparoscopic colectomy].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>877-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors report a case of pneumatosis cystoides intestinalis which, after failure of medical treatment, was treated by laparoscopic partial colectomy. Surgical treatment is a last resort and the laparoscopically-assisted approach seems to be a good indication in colectomy for pneumatosis cystoides intestinalis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
